    "description": "You use your riding experience to improve your skills on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Speeder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Speeder\">Speeder</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swoop_Bike\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swoop Bike\">Swoop Bike</a>. When riding a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Speeder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Speeder\">Speeder</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swoop_Bike\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swoop Bike\">Swoop Bike</a> (or another, similar <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a>), you can use the following applications of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ride\" title=\"Ride\">Ride</a> skill: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fast_Mount_or_Dismount\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fast Mount or Dismount\">Fast Mount or Dismount</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Soft_Fall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Soft Fall\">Soft Fall</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stay_in_Saddle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stay in Saddle\">Stay in Saddle</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Mount_as_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Mount as Cover\">Use Mount as Cover</a>.",
